# nx-lookup

- Solo `type` + `params` (`pageSize` default 10). `type` = snake_case del modelo Vertex (`account`, `brand`, `payment_method`).
- Contrato: `GET /api/v1/lookup` → `{ id, name, code }`. Resolución automática por `{Model}QueryBuilder` (no registry manual de tipos).
- Mapper JS solo name/code. Doc: `docs/components/NX-LOOKUP.md` · Vertex `docs/architecture/04-lookup.md`.
